title: "Can My Pet Eat This? Small-pet food safety dataset (hamsters, budgies, cockatiels)"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: JOMIZOO
    website: "https://jomizoo.com/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/limocax-pixel/jomizoo-can-eat"
url: "https://limocax-pixel.github.io/jomizoo-can-eat/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-25
keywords:
  - hamster
  - budgerigar
  - cockatiel
  - pet nutrition
  - food safety
