abstract: >-
  Food-safety verdicts on a four-level scale (yes, small amounts, better not, never) for
  68 foods across pet hamsters, budgies and cockatiels, with portions, preparation, risks,
  source citations, evidence type and confidence, plus USDA nutrient values.
